WEBVTT

00:33:56.371 --> 00:34:00.496
She was able to pursue a new project which
eventually launched her career

00:34:00.496 --> 00:34:01.496
as an entrepreneur.

00:34:01.746 --> 00:34:07.329
And I am the founder and president of
Dandelion Energy, a geothermal startup.

00:34:12.788 --> 00:34:15.121
Every time I talk about escalation
of commitment,

00:34:15.496 --> 00:34:19.121
whether it's with startup founders
or military generals or students,

00:34:19.454 --> 00:34:24.246
there's one question that always comes
up is one person's escalation,

00:34:24.371 --> 00:34:26.371
another's heroic persistence.

00:34:26.496 --> 00:34:30.079
If you think about it, most
of our Hollywood movies,